# --- Dependencies ---
# Web JS deps: restored with `bun install`, never committed.
web/node_modules/
node_modules/

# --- Dev caches ---
# Host-mounted Go module + build cache shared by the docker-compose dev
# services (see the `./.cache/go-modules` mounts in docker-compose.yml).
.cache/

# --- Build outputs ---
# Tailwind/bun emit into static/public from sources in static/src — generated,
# rebuilt by `bun run build` (or the watchers in dev). Source lives in static/src/.
web/static/public/

# Compiled Go binaries (dev builds; we prefer `go vet`/`go run`).
/api/api
/web/web
*.exe

# --- Local env / secrets ---
.env
.env.local
*.local.env

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOTE: generated Go stubs (api/proto/**/*.pb.go, api/db/*.sql.go) and Templ
# output (web/views/*_templ.go) ARE committed — matching the project convention
# so a fresh clone builds without a codegen step. Do not ignore them.
